    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "label": "Lesson 13 • Discussing A Mistake",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Chris and Todd work for Alpine Design, a furniture manufacturer. When Todd accidentally orders the wrong amount of wood, his boss Chris warns him to be more careful in the future."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Chris: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Todd, we got our shipment of wood yesterday. We’re "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "short by"
                },
                {
                  "text": " 18 tons."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Todd: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Our wood supplier must’ve made a mistake.  "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "I could’ve sworn that"
                },
                {
                  "text": " I ordered the right amount."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Chris: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Chris: You’d better go back and double-check your order."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Todd: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Oops, you’re right. I accidentally ordered two tons instead of twenty. "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "No big deal"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". I’ll just put in another order."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Chris: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "When filling out order forms, you need to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "dot your i’s and cross your t’s"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". You shouldn’t be making careless mistakes like this."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Todd: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I just forgot to add a zero after the two. Don’t "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "make a mountain out of a molehill"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". No need to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "blow things out of proportion."
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Chris: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "This is very serious. Now we won’t have enough wood to finish the furniture order we got from La-Z Boy."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Todd: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Okay, sorry I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "dropped the ball"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Chris: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Todd, this may be a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "bitter pill to swallow"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", but your work lately hasn’t been "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "up to scratch"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". You’ve really been "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "asleep at the wheel"
                },
                {
                  "text": "!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
